 3x"}, "body": "Hi, can I commission a drawing in which Ashley Taylor (image 1) will be in a similar situation as Bocchi (image 2)? I would like for Ashley’s oppai to be as large as Bocchi’s, or even larger if possible. Her lingerie might be styled as such (image 3).\n\nFor the expression, I was curious if you might do something more playful. Ashley is a bit more confident than Bocchi, so I don’t think she’d be this nervous. I hope that’s okay.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/1awqMk2", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@minorun9/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 299024, "client_id": 169953, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0ba17d85/uploads/origins/db227703-0f00-471f-9360-bf3939ebca27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8e5c6d5f144e91ecff21a3f7d941422", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0ba17d85/uploads/origins/db227703-0f00-471f-9360-bf3939ebca27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8e5c6d5f144e91ecff21a3f7d941422, https://si.imgix.net/0ba17d85/uploads/origins/db227703-0f00-471f-9360-bf3939ebca27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ddb8476c7fb97fa04cbb7374a733c0c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0ba17d85/uploads/origins/db227703-0f00-471f-9360-bf3939ebca27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fafa03a52084761d00f0caba5c369d9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0ba17d85/uploads/origins/db227703-0f00-471f-9360-bf3939ebca27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=302b97f445f699eacc912682668fd269", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0ba17d85/uploads/origins/db227703-0f00-471f-9360-bf3939ebca27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=w